ad, Executive Director Union Bank of India SRC Member\nSRC Member\n6 Shri Rohan Chand Thakur, Govt. Nominee Director\n(Till 13.05.2026) Union Bank of India\nACB Member\n7 Dr. Debasish Prusty, Govt Nominee Director\n(w.e.f. 13.05.2026) Union Bank of India ACB Member\nUnion Bank of India ACB Member","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1352","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":519,"text":"Union Bank of India ACB Member\n8 Shri Prakash Baliarsingh, RBI Nominee Director\nUBI Services Limited ACB Member\n9 Shri Suraj Srivastava, Part-Time Non-Official Director\nACB Chairperson\n(Till 10.04.2026) Union Bank of India\nSRC Member\nUnion Bank of India SRC Chairperson\nTata AIG General Insurance\n10 Shri Prakash Chandra Kandpal\nCompany Limited ACB Chairperson\nShareholder Director\nSRC Member\nNucleus Software Exports\nLimited\nACB Chairperson\nSRC Member\n11 Dr. Priti Jay Rao,\nShareholder Director Union Bank of India\nACB Member\n167 Union Bank of India | Integrated Annual Report 2025-26\nGRI Index Capitals Strategy About\nCorporate Governance Report\n2.10 Details of Familiarization Programmes attended\nSl. No. Date of Meeting Sl. No.\nDate of Meeting\nby Directors: The details of training programmes\nattended by Directors of the Bank are made available\n1. 23 April 2025 12. 24 October 2025\non Bank’s website under the following link:https://www.\nunionbankofindia.bank.in/en/common/shareholders-\n2. 08 May 2025 13. 30 October 2025\ninformation\n3. 05 June 2025 14. 03 November 2025\n2.11 In terms of requirement of Schedule V of the Listing\n4. 13 June 2025 15. 12 November 2025\nRegulations, a Practicing Company Secretary has\n5. 25 June 2025 16. 08 December 2025\ncertified that none of the directors on the Board of the\nBank have been debarred or disqualified from being\n6. 19 July 2025 17. 06 January 2026","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report ·