"c1403","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":540,"text":"31.03.2026 (`)\n1. UBI 066221090000005 2021-22 ` 1.90 per share 11.08.29 3,39,11,423.00\n2. UBI 317901090049834 2022-23 ` 3.00 per share 15.09.30 4,99,14,133.00\n3. UBI 066221090000026 2023-24 ` 3.60 per share 01.09.31 7,77,61,609.60\n4. UBI 066221090000054 2024-25 ` 4.75 per share 01.08.32 9,88,31,766.00\nTOTAL 26,04,18,931.60\nThe shareholders who have not claimed the above dividends till now are requested to make a claim at the earliest to the Registrar & Share Transfer Agent or the Investor Services Division of the Bank. A format of indemnity bond in this respect is available on the website of the bank (www.unionbankofindia.bank.in).\n188 Union Bank of India | Integrated Annual Report 2025-26\nFinancials Reports Notice\n9.13 Unclaimed Shares:\na) In Physical Form:\nAs per Schedule VI of the SEBI (Listing Obligations & Disclosure Requirements), 2015 i.e. Manner of Dealing with Unclaimed Shares, the Bank opened an Unclaimed Suspense Account in March 2012 after completion of procedure as instructed by SEBI. The shares issued in physical form during IPO of the Bank in the year 2002, which are still unclaimed are controlled in this account. The details of the shares lying in this account are as follows:\nParticulars No. of shareholders No. of shares\nBalance as of 01.04.2025 lying in Demat Suspense Account 4 600\nShareholders approached for transfer during the financial year 2025-26 NIL NIL","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1404","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":541,"text":"Shareholders approached for transfer during the financial year 2025-26 NIL NIL\nShareholders to whom shares were transferred during the year 2025-26 NIL NIL\nBalance as on 31.03.2026 lying in Demat Suspense Account 4 600\nb) In Demat Form:\nAs per Schedule VI of the SEBI (Listing Obligations & Disclosure Requirements), 2015 i.e. Manner of Dealing with Unclaimed Shares, the Bank has opened a Demat Suspense Account in March 2010 after completion of procedure as instructed by SEBI. The shares allotted to the applicants at the time of Bank’s FPO during 2006 but not credited to their respective demat account due to some technical reasons are controlled in this account. The details of the shares lying in this account are as follows:\nParticulars (UBI-FPO) No. of shareholders No. of shares\nBalance as of 01.04.2025 lying in Demat Suspense Account 213 25809\nShareholders approached for transfer during the financial year 2025-26 0 0\nShareholders to whom shares were transferred during the year 2025-26 0 0\nBalance as on 31.03.2026 lying in Demat Suspense Account 213 25809\nNo. of shares\nParticulars (E-AB and E-CB) No. of shareholders\nBalance as of 01.04.2025 lying in Demat Suspense Account 168 13089\nShareholders approached for transfer during the financial year 2025-26 0 0\nShareholders to whom shares were transferred during the year 2025-26 0 0","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1405","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":541,"text":"Shareholders to whom shares were transferred during the year 2025-26 0 0\nBalance as on 31.03.2026 lying in Demat Suspense Account 168 13089\nNo. of shares\nParticulars (UBI – Letter of Confirmation) No. of shareholders\nBalance as of 01.04.2025 lying in Demat Suspense Account 45 17146\nShareholders approached for transfer during the financial year 2025-26 8 1974\nShareholders to whom shares were transferred during the year 2025-26 8 1974\n14 6264\nShareholders to whom shares are transferred from PHY to Demat Suspense Account during the year 2025-26\nBalance as on 31.03.2026 lying in Demat Suspense Account 43 21436\nThe voting rights on above- mentioned all shares shall remain frozen till the rightful owner of these shares